{"step_index":286,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-17T16:29:10Z","content":"**Gemini 3.6 Flash (`gemini-3.6-flash` / Perseus)** is available and is a strong model choice for this architecture.\n\n---\n\n### Why Gemini 3.6 Flash is Well-Suited for this HR Agent\n\n1. **State-of-the-Art Tool Calling & Schema Precision:**\n   * In agentic workflows like ours (which require structured function calls to WorkWeek, ServiceImmediately, and Vector Search), **Gemini 3.6 Flash** provides high adherence to strict JSON schemas, reducing parameter mismatch and tool execution errors.\n2. **Ultra-Low Latency (Sub-300ms TTFT):**\n   * It is optimized for high-throughput, low-latency streaming. This makes meeting our NFR targets (**$p50 < 1.2\\text{s}$ and $p95 < 2.8\\text{s}$**) easy to achieve on Cloud Run.\n3. **Multi-Turn Context & Instruction Following:**\n   * It handles long session histories, Human-in-the-Loop (HITL) confirmation flows, and prompt boundaries without losing conversational state or leaking system prompts.\n4. **Cost & Scalability:**\n   * It delivers near-frontier reasoning at a fraction of the cost and compute footprint of Pro-tier models, making it cost-effective for high-volume Tier-1 deflection.\n\n---\n\n### Recommended Model Tiering Architecture\n\n| Role | Recommended Model | Purpose in HR Agent Solution |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Primary Agent Orchestrator & Tool Calling** | **`gemini-3.6-flash`** | • Intent recognition & dialog management.<br>• Real-time function calling to WorkWeek & ServiceImmediately.<br>• Grounded answer generation with deep-link citations.<br>• Rendering HITL Confirmation Cards. |\n| **High-Speed Guardrail & Intent Classifier (Optional)** | **`gemini-3.5-flash-lite`** | • Sub-100ms prompt injection & domain pre-screening before hitting the main agent. |\n| **Complex SAGA & Policy Conflict Synthesis (Fallback)** | **`gemini-3-pro` / `gemini-2.5-pro`** | • Deep reasoning fallback for multi-policy disputes or complex chained SAGA workflows. |\n\n---\n\n### Key Questions for Alignment\n\n1. **Should we set `gemini-3.6-flash` as the single primary foundation model** across the entire solution (Orchestrator, RAG Grounding, and Tool Execution)?\n2. **Would you like to pair it with Vertex AI Search (Managed Grounding)** or a **Vertex AI Vector Search (ScaNN)** pipeline?\n\nOnce we agree, I can update `design.md` with these latest model configurations and architectural updates!","thinking":"**Confirming Model Availability**\n\nI've confirmed that `gemini-3.6-flash`, also referred to as `Gemini 3.6 Flash` and identified internally as `gemini-v4p1s-rev25-perseus` (Perseus), is indeed the latest Flash model in Google's internal systems and accessible via Vertex AI (`vertex-ai:gemini-3.6-flash`).\n\n\n"}
