{"step_index":306,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-17T16:32:26Z","content":"The **System Design Document (`design.md`)** has been updated to incorporate the **Gemini 3.6 Flash** stack and modernized Google Cloud Platform services.\n\n* 📄 **Markdown File (Direct Local Artifact):** [design.md](file:///usr/local/google/home/gauravrawat/.gemini/jetski/brain/ca4322d4-9341-4bd7-ad62-33640faaced0/design.md)\n* 📁 **Workspace Copy:** [design.md](file:///google/src/cloud/gauravrawat/summarize_latest_chats/google3/hr_agentic_solution/design.md)\n* 🔗 **Google Docs Link:** [HR Agentic Solution - System Design Document (Gemini 3.6 Flash Edition)](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1PsxHuHGj9XUuIRLGBuehMwOu7ui1CbU7kZeCFEvkBrM/edit)\n* 📂 **Google Drive Project Folder:** [HR Agentic Solution - Project Artifacts](https://drive.google.com/corp/drive/folders/115mF5i6YL6YdECFDMdHJoO5gYTXVxEvl)\n\n---\n\n### Key Architectural Updates in Version 3.0.0\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                                MODERNIZED ARCHITECTURE MATRIX                                   │\n├───────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────┤\n│ Architecture Layer            │ Updated Modernized Component     │ Key Architectural Advantage  │\n├───────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────┤\n│ 1. Primary AI Foundation      │ Gemini 3.6 Flash                 │ • Sub-300ms TTFT streaming   │\n│    Model                      │ (`gemini-3.6-flash` / Perseus)   │ • High tool-calling accuracy │\n│                               │                                  │ • Strict JSON schema output  │\n├───────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────┤\n│ 2. High-Speed Classifier &    │ Gemini 3.5 Flash-Lite            │ • Sub-100ms intent routing   │\n│    Safety Pre-Screening       │ (`gemini-3.5-flash-lite`/Thorin) │ • Low-cost pre-filtering     │\n├───────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────┤\n│ 3. Deep Reasoning Fallback    │ Gemini 2.5 Pro / Gemini 3 Pro    │ • Complex multi-policy SAGA  │\n├───────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────┤\n│ 4. Managed Grounding (RAG)    │ Vertex AI Search Grounding       │ • Native PDF layout parsing  │\n│                               │ + Vector Search (ScaNN 2.0)      │ • Clickable deep citations   │\n├───────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────┤\n│ 5. High-Throughput Egress     │ Cloud Run Direct VPC Egress      │ • Eliminates legacy Server-  │\n│                               │                                  │   less VPC Connector delays  │\n├───────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────┤\n│ 6. In-Memory Session Cache    │ Memorystore for Valkey 7.2+      │ • 20% higher QPS than Redis  │\n│                               │                                  │ • 30m TTL & Mutex action lock│\n├───────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────┤\n│ 7. AI Threat Defense          │ Vertex AI Model Armor            │ • Real-time prompt firewall  │\n│                               │ Sensitive Data Protection (DLP)  │ • Real-time SPII redaction   │\n├───────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────┤\n│ 8. Infrastructure as Code     │ HashiCorp Terraform Blueprint    │ • Updated for Valkey, Direct │\n│                               │                                  │   VPC & Gemini 3.6 Flash     │\n└───────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n### Updated Latency Budget Matrix\n\n```\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                              UPDATED GCP LATENCY SLA MATRIX                            │\n├──────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────┤\n│ Component / Request Type     │ Target Latency (p50)    │ Target Latency (p95)          │\n├──────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┤\n│ Cloud Armor + Edge Ingress   │ < 20 ms                 │ < 40 ms                       │\n│ Vertex AI Model Armor Scan   │ < 80 ms                 │ < 180 ms                      │\n│ Gemini 3.6 Flash TTFT (SSE)  │ < 280 ms                │ < 550 ms                      │\n│ Vertex AI Search Grounding   │ < 200 ms   